  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Combating Wildlife Crime (CWC)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">(Uganda):  The Combating Wildlife Crime Activity aims to reduce wildlife crime and trafficking. Building on lessons learned and complementing other ongoing biodiversity conservation activities, FY 2022 funds will be used to: 1) strengthen wildlife protection and the leadership skills and capacity of law enforcement personnel; 2) improve cooperation and data-sharing among government institutions, civil society, and the private sector to improve enforcement; and 3) promote data-driven conservation approaches through research, analysis, and information management. The Activity will coordinate closely with the Mission&apos;s flagship Accountability activity to enhance transparency and build partnerships to combat wildlife crime-related corruption..</narrative>
  </description>
